></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AONO, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SANTEN PHARMACEUTICAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKAI, MIWA</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>AONO HIROYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKAI MIWA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AONO, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKAI, MIWA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An additional novel pharmacological effect of useful mercaptoacylcysteine derivatives. Remedies for arthrosis deformans comprising compounds represented by general formula [I] or salts thereof as the active ingredient. In formula [I], A represents lower alkylene exemplified by linear or branched C1-6 alkylene such as methylene, ethylene, (dimethyl)methylene and (diethyl)methylene.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un nouvel effet pharmacologique supplémentaire des dérivés utiles de mercaptoacylcystéine. L'invention concerne également des remèdes contre la polyarthrite rhumatoïde contenant des composés représentés par la formule générale (I) ou bien leurs sels en tant que principe actif. Dans la formule (I), A représente alkylène inférieur exemplifié par l'alkylène C1-C6 linéaire ou ramifié tel que méthylène, éthylène, (diméthyl)méthylène et (diéthyl)méthylène.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledg